  "description": "Hopscotch is a lightweight resource pack which simplifies the texture of redstone dust and adds a decimal and hexadecimal overlay on top of it to represent its signal strength!",
  "body": "### Overview\n\nHopscotch is a lightweight resource pack which simplifies the texture of redstone dust and adds a decimal and hexadecimal overlay on top of it!\n\nWhile there have been many resource packs in the past dedicated to this, Hopscotch offers a minalistic yet practical option through its incorporation of both decimal and hexadecimal values alongside a familiar look to the dust itself.\n\n### Showcase\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/CCCNJ4LFf1Q\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n###  Key Features\n> That's all it does!\n\n> Useful for computational redstone\n\n> Not useful as an emotional support plushie\n\nThis resource pack will be updated to future versions but will not change.\n\nWhy are you still reading this? bye bye! ヾ(•ω•`)o\n\n-- Flyingdean",
